# Scanned paper attendance sheets. This repository is public and the scans are
# student names, roll numbers and signatures, so they stay on the machine that
# transcribes them. The transcription itself lives in backend/data, which is
# ignored for the same reason.
Attendance/
# The 10 Sept 2026 batch (31 Aug - 8 Sep sheets). Only the scans are kept out;
# the workbook transcribed from them is committed on purpose.
Attendance new/*.pdf

